    "created_at": "2018-05-31T10:38:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-31T11:20:49Z",
    "body": "So unfortunately that was not enough to solve the issue. I've added a bunch of debugging features to  pr-preview, and it seems that there's some issues with wattsi. I always request two zip files from it, one for the head and the other for the merge base. One of it always ends up with a pretty much empty `multipage-html` directory. \r\n\r\nCould wattsi have issues dealing with concurrent requests?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
