    "created_at": "2018-05-31T10:49:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-31T11:21:59Z",
    "body": "Serializing the requests to wattsi makes the issue go away, which points to a concurrence problem in wattsi server.\r\n\r\nI'll keep the requests serialized here, so that will reduce the incidence of such issues, but it won't make them go away completely, and the more wattsi server is used, the more this issue will show up.",
